return ['domain'=>'zinn-chat','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'ha','project-id-version'=>'zinn-chat','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-25T17:31:44+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-25T17:31:44+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Chat'=>'Zinn® Chat','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-chat'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-chat','A fast, privacy-respecting live chat for your website. Answers visitors with AI when you are busy, hands them to you when they need a person, and emails you anything you miss. Under 10 KB on the page and no requests at all until somebody opens it.'=>'Wani tattaunawa ta kai-tsaye mai sauri wacce ke kare sirri don shafinku na yanar gizo. Tana amsa wa baƙi da fasahar AI lokacin da kuke aiki, tana mika su gare ku lokacin da suke buƙatar mutum, kuma tana turo muku imel na duk abin da kuka rasa. Kasa da KB 10 a shafin kuma babu buƙatu ko kaɗan har sai wani ya buɗe ta.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Settings'=>'Saituna','That does not look like a Zinn® Chat key. Copy it from the Live chat page of your Zinn Digital® dashboard — it starts with zc_.'=>'Wannan bai yi kama da maɓallin Zinn® Chat ba. Ka kwafe shi daga shafin Live chat na allo na Zinn Digital® naka — yana farawa da zc_.','Add your chat key before switching the chat on — without it there is nothing for the widget to connect to.'=>'Ƙara maɓallin tattaunawarka kafin ka kunna tattaunawar — ba tare da shi ba babu abin da widget din zai haɗa da shi.','Live chat for this site. Visitors get an answer straight away, you get anything you miss by email, and the whole thing is under 10 KB on the page.'=>'Tattaunawa kai tsaye don wannan shafin. Baƙi suna samun amsa nan da nan, kuna samun duk abin da kuka rasa ta imel, kuma duka abin yana ƙasan 10 KB a shafin.','The chat is live on this site.'=>'Tattaunawar tana kan layi a wannan shafin.','The chat is switched off. Nothing is loaded on your site.'=>'An kashe tattaunawar. Babu abin da aka ɗora a shafin ku.','Chat key'=>'Maɓallin tattaunawa','Copy this from the Live chat page of your %s.'=>'Kwafi wannan daga shafin tattaunawa ta kai tsaye na %s naka.','Zinn Digital® dashboard'=>'Babban shafi na Zinn Digital®','Show the chat'=>'Nuna hira','Show the chat window to visitors of this site'=>'Nuna taga ta hira ga masu ziyartar wannan shafin','Until you tick this, the plugin adds nothing at all to your pages — no script, no cookie, no requests.'=>'Har sai ka saka alamar dubawa a nan, plugin din ba ya ƙara komai sam a shafukanka — babu rubutun shiri, babu kuki, babu buƙatu.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — jagorori da ayyuka','User guides'=>'Jagororin mai amfani','Read the %s user guide'=>'Karanta jagorar mai amfani ta %s','Hide this'=>'Boye da wannan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Zinn® hosting don WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, ajiyar bayanai ta kullum, ƙaura kyauta da kuma allon sarrafawa da aka gina domin mutanen da ke sarrafa shafuka fiye da ɗaya.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Kasuwancin Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Sayen da sayar da shafuka da suka riga suka kafa, da yankuna, da kuma wuraren sanya hanyoyin sadarwa, tare da ajiyar kudi cikin aminci har sai bangarorin biyu sun gamsu.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — hayar mutanen da ke yin wannan don rayuwa','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Kasuwancinmu na masu zaman kansu na duniya: bincika ayyuka sama da 10,000 da aka riga aka shirya daga marubuta, masu zanen kaya, masu haɓakawa da ƙwararrun SEO, ko sanya wani aikin kuma bari su yi gwanjo.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Duba bayanan fitarwa na Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sabuntawar da aka sauke ta gaza a wajen tantance amincinta kuma ba a sanya ta ba.','Everything here keeps working for nothing, for ever. Pro is for when one person answering, and a month of history, stops being enough.'=>'Komai a nan yana cigaba da aiki kyauta, har abada. Pro na lokacin da mutum daya ke ba da amsa, da wata daya na tarihin, sun daina isa.','As many colleagues answering at once as you like — the free plugin allows one.'=>'Kamar yadda kuke so abokan aiki da yawa su amsa lokaci ɗaya — kyautar plugin tana ba da damar mutum ɗaya.','Every conversation kept for ever, instead of thirty days.'=>'Kowane tattaunawa an adana shi har abada, maimakon kwanaki talatin.','Your own name on the chat window, with ours removed.'=>'Sunanka a kan taga ta tattaunawa, an cire namu.','Saved replies, transfer a conversation to a colleague, and business hours.'=>'Amsoshin da aka adana, tura tattaunawa ga abokin aiki, da kuma lokutan aiki.','5,000 AI answers a month rather than 100.'=>'Amsoshin AI 5,000 a wata maimakon 100.','Choose exactly which pages the chat appears on — or hide it from the checkout.'=>'Zaɓi takamaiman shafukan da hira za ta bayyana a kai — ko kuma ka ɓoye shi daga shafin biyan kuɗi.','One licence covers three of your sites; ten-site licences are available.'=>'Lasisi ɗaya tana rufe shafukanku guda uku; akwai lasisin shafuka goma.','See what Pro costs'=>'Duba abin da Pro ke ci','Already host a site with Zinn Digital®? Pro is included free — your key is on the %s.'=>'Kuna da shafin da aka karbi bakuncinsa a Zinn Digital® tuni? An haɗa da Pro kyauta — mabuɗinku yana kan %s.','Licences page of your dashboard'=>'Shafin lasisi na allon kula da ku','Your licence is active.'=>'Lasisin ku yana aiki.','Your licence has run out but everything still works for a short while. Renew it to keep receiving updates.'=>'Lasisin ka ya ƙare amma komai na ci gaba da aiki na ɗan lokaci kaɗan. Sabunta shi domin ci gaba da karɓar sabuntawa.','We do not recognise that licence key. Copy it again from the Licences page of your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Ba mu gane wannan mukullin lasisin ba. Sake kwafa shi daga shafin Lasisi na allon kulawa na Zinn Digital® naka.','That key is for a different Zinn® plugin. The one you want is on the Licences page of your dashboard, next to Zinn® Chat Pro.'=>'Waccan key din na wani ɗan tasha ne na daban na Zinn®. Wanda kake so yana kan shafin Lasisi na allon kulawanka, kusa da Zinn® Chat Pro.','Your licence has expired. Renew it from your Zinn Digital® dashboard to switch the Pro features back on.'=>'Lasisin ku ya kare. Sabunta shi daga allon kula na Zinn Digital® don sake kunna fasalolin Pro.','This licence has been cancelled.'=>'An soke wannan lasisin.','This licence is on hold. Please get in touch and we will sort it out.'=>'Wannan lasisin yana a tsaya. Da fatan za a tuntuɓe mu kuma za mu shawo kan matsalar.','There is a billing problem on your Zinn Digital® account. Once it is settled the licence works again straight away.'=>'Akwai matsalar lissafin kudi a kan asusun Zinn Digital® naka. Da zaran an daidaita ta, lasisin zai sake yin aiki nan take.','This licence came free with your Zinn® hosting, and that hosting has ended. Buy a licence, or start hosting with us again, to switch Pro back on.'=>'Wannan lasisin ya zo kyauta ne tare da daukar nauyin gidan yanar gizon ku na Zinn®, kuma wancan daukar nauyin ya ƙare. Sayi lasisi, ko sake fara daukar nauyi tare da mu, don kunna Pro kuma.','Every site on this licence is in use. Release one below, or upgrade to cover more sites.'=>'Kowane shafi a kan wannan lasisin yana amfani. Sake fitar da ɗaya a ƙasa, ko kuma inganta don ɗaukar ƙarin shafuka.','We could not confirm your licence just now. Nothing has changed on your site; we will try again shortly.'=>'Ba mu iya tabbatar da lasisin ku a yanzu ba. Babu wani abu da ya Canza a shafin ku; za mu sake gwadawa nan ba da dadewa ba.','You do not have permission to manage licences on this site.'=>'Ba ka da izinin sarrafa lasisi a wannan shafin.','Your Pro licence'=>'Lasisin Pro naka','Licence key'=>'Maɓullin lasisi','Copy it from the Licences page of your %s.'=>'Kwafi shi daga shafin lasisi na %s naka.','Renews on %s.'=>'Za a sabunta a ranar %s.','Using %1$d of %2$d sites.'=>'Ana amfani da shafuka %1$d daga cikin %2$d.','In use on: %s. Release one from your dashboard, then try again.'=>'Ana amfani da shi a kan: %s. Saki daya daga allon sarrafa ku, sannan ku sake gwadawa.','Save licence'=>'Ajiye lasisi','Remove it from this site'=>'Cire shi daga wannan shafin','Where the chat appears'=>'Inda hirar ta bayyana','Show it'=>'Nuna shi','Everywhere on this site'=>'Ko\'ina a wannan shafin','Only on the pages I choose below'=>'A shafukan da na zaba a kasa kadai','Everywhere except the pages I choose below'=>'Ko ina in ban da shafukan da na zaba a kasa ba','Page or post IDs'=>'Lambobin shafi ko rubutu','Separate them with commas. The ID is in the address bar while you edit a page.'=>'Raba su da waƙafi. ID ɗin yana cikin mashigin adireshin yayin da kake gyara shafi.','Whole content types'=>'Dukan nau\'ikan abubuwa','Signed-in visitors'=>'Masu ziyara da suka shiga','Hide the chat from people who are signed in to this site'=>'Boye da hira daga mutanen da suka shiga shafin nan','Save where it appears'=>'Adana inda ya bayyana']];